fields.value:
{{Stealnotes
| name = Bedlam
| desc = Can be cast while {{A|Dark Willow|Terrorize}} is active, if both Terrorize and Bedlam are not in {{A|Rubick|Stolen Spell 1}} and {{A|Rubick|Stolen Spell 2}} respectively.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Bedlam icon0}}
| desc = Dark Willow sends her pet wisp to roam around herself for the duration, rapidly attacking nearby enemies.  Bedlam cannot be used while Terrorize is active.
}}
* {{U|Jex}} has the additional properties:
** Orbits around Mireska at {{Symbol|bonus aoe}} {{#expr:pi*{{#var:Bedlam type1 value1}}*2/{{#var:Bedlam type1 value6}} round2}}-{{M|projectile speed|text=speed}}.
** {{Symbol|fx|v}}
*** Has a pink-like hue ability effects indicating its attack radius.
** {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|dark_willow_bedlam}}
*** Jex disappears immediately once the buff expires on Mireska.
** {{Symbol|Projectile|Travel}}
*** Has a {{#var:Bedlam value2}} ({{Symbol|bonus t1r}} {{ValueColor||{{#var:Bedlam value2 tal}}|10tal}})-second max duration, and does not exceed this value if the unit can travel ahead.

* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** The pink glowing ability effects indicates Jex's attack search radius visible to everyone.

* Deals up to the following max {{M|spell damage}}:
: {{{!}} class="wikitable" style="text-align:center; margin-top:3px; font-size:80%;"
{{!}}-
! style="width:46px;" {{!}} [[File:Dota2 Dark Willow Bedlam icon.png|18px|Bedlam]]
! style="width:46px;" {{!}} {{cf|Level|1}}
! style="width:46px;" {{!}} {{cf|Level|2}}
! style="width:46px;" {{!}} {{cf|Level|3}}
{{!}}- 
! {{Symbol|Spell Damage|size=18px}}
{{!}} {{#invoke:Lua|invoke|module=loop|fn=i|0|3|<nowiki>{{#expr:{{#var:Bedlam damage inst}}*{{#explode:{{#var:Bedlam type1 value5}}|/|{{#var:i}}}}}}
{{!}}</nowiki>}}-
! {{Symbol|bonus t2r|size=18px}}
{{!}} 
{{!}} {{#invoke:Lua|invoke|module=loop|fn=i|1|2|<nowiki>style="{{#ifexpr:{{#var:i}}>0|{{ValueColor/El|tal}}}}" {{!}} {{#expr:{{#var:Bedlam damage inst}}*{{#explode:{{#var:Bedlam type1 value5 tal}}|/|{{#var:i}}}}}}
{{!}}</nowiki>}}-
! {{Symbol|bonus t4r|size=18px}}
{{!}}
{{!}}
{{!}} style="{{#ifexpr:{{#var:i}}>0|{{ValueColor/El|tal}}}}" {{!}} {{#expr:{{#var:Bedlam damage inst}}*{{#explode:{{#var:Bedlam type1 value5}}|/|2}}*{{#var:Bedlam type1 value3 tal}}}}
{{!}}-
! {{Symbol|bonus t4l2r|size=18px}}
{{!}}
{{!}}
{{!}} style="{{#ifexpr:{{#var:i}}>0|{{ValueColor/El|tal}}}}" {{!}} {{#expr:{{#var:Bedlam damage inst}}*{{#explode:{{#var:Bedlam type1 value5 tal}}|/|2}}*{{#var:Bedlam type1 value3 tal}}}}
{{!}}}

