* {{Symbol|fx|v}}
** {{U|Jex}} appears 300-distance {{M|upward movement|text=upward}} and above Mireska during the ability's {{M|cast point}}.
** The ability casting effects during its cast point is visible ally-only.

* {{Symbol|fx|s}} 
** The sound effects during its cast point is audible to everyone.

